Provenance of the underlying material
-------------------------------------
These files are derived from publicly available records and publications and
are not original sequence data:

  - Genome assemblies and sequencing reads were obtained from the NCBI
    Assembly database and the NCBI Sequence Read Archive. Accession numbers
    for all 921 genomes are listed in results/tables/table_s1_accessions.csv.

  - Published cgMLST cluster labels (wang2022_cgmlst_clusters_602.csv) are
    taken from the supplementary material of Wang Z, Gu C, Sun L, Zhao F,
    Fu Y, Di L, et al. Development of a novel core genome MLST scheme for
    tracing multidrug resistant Staphylococcus capitis. Nat Commun
    2022;13:4254. doi:10.1038/s41467-022-31908-x

  - cgMLST and seven-locus allele calls were produced with MBioSEQ Ridom
    Typer. The allele definitions of those schemes are curated and
    distributed by Ridom and are available to licensed users of the software;
    they are not redistributed here. Only the allele calls for the genomes
    analysed in this study are included.

